        <mxCell id="n12" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;font-weight:bold;line-height:145%&quot;&gt;모드 관리와 서보 출력&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontColor=#C66A13;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1325" y="290" width="420" height="45" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n13" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;font-weight:bold;line-height:145%&quot;&gt;2D → 3D → 사람 관절각&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:21px;line-height:145%;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;프레임 중복 확인 / 제어 팔 전환&lt;br&gt;2D Landmark 안정화 · 시간 기반 EMA&lt;br&gt;링크 길이 제약으로 3D 위치 복원&lt;br&gt;Base · Shoulder · Elbow 계산&lt;br&gt;Wrist · Gripper 계산&lt;br&gt;누락 시 hold 또는 부분 갱신&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontColor=#2563EB;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=1.5;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="315" y="360" width="400" height="375" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n14" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;font-weight:bold;line-height:145%&quot;&gt;사람 관절각 → 로봇 명령&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:21px;line-height:145%;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;입력 검증 / 각도 경계 unwrap&lt;br&gt;5개 관절 보정과 가동 범위 제한&lt;br&gt;2D 정기구학 기반 목표 안전검사&lt;br&gt;5개 관절 공통 이동 시간 계산&lt;br&gt;고정 제어 틱 · 스무딩 / 변화량 제한&lt;br&gt;그리퍼 값은 변경 없이 전달&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontColor=#087F6B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#087F6B;strokeWidth=1.5;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="825" y="360" width="400" height="375" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n15" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;font-weight:bold;line-height:145%&quot;&gt;로봇 명령 → PWM 설정&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:21px;line-height:145%;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;FOLLOW / RECORD / PLAYBACK&lt;br&gt;실시간 명령 선택 · 기록 또는 재생&lt;br&gt;서보별 범위 · 방향 · 보정 적용&lt;br&gt;각도 → 펄스 폭 변환&lt;br&gt;servo_hw → AXI 레지스터&lt;br&gt;PL PWM IP → 6채널 출력&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontColor=#C66A13;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C66A13;strokeWidth=1.5;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1335" y="360" width="400" height="375" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n16" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:26px;font-weight:bold;line-height:145%&quot;&gt;로봇팔 · 서보 ×6&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;line-height:145%;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;Base / Shoulder / Elbow&lt;br&gt;Wrist Pitch / Wrist Roll / Gripper&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontColor=#172B4D;fillColor=#EDF2F7;strokeColor=#172B4D;strokeWidth=1.5;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
