        <mxCell id="n36" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;line-height:145%&quot;&gt;Wrist Roll 안정화 순서&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:18px;line-height:145%;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;Hand normal sign flip 보정 → Normal EMA → ±180° unwrap&lt;br&gt;→ Spike suppression (변화량 최대 35°) → Roll EMA → Zero calibration&lt;br&gt;주의: spike 억제 결과에 EMA가 다시 적용되므로 최종 wrist_roll_deg는 더 완만하게 변함&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontColor=#2563EB;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=1.5;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
